: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">SF2014(science&amp;future)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">를 올 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">9</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">26</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">일 개최합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이 중 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">20, 30</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 후 근미래에 과학기술로 우리 사회가 얼마나 변화할 수 있을지를 주제로 과학자와 인문사회학자가 그 가능성을 진단해보는 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">SF</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">포럼</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">미래과학기술포럼</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">은 과학기술과 사회</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(STS) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">및 미래 과학기술</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, SF</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">에 관심있는 모든 대학생과 일반인들이 참여할 수 있는 프로그램입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">아 래 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\